&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tool-Skills &amp;amp; Analytik:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Sehr gute Office-365-Skills (insbesondere Excel, PowerPoint, Outlook) verbindest du mit hoher Zahlenaffi

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Das bieten wir dir:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work-Life-Balance&lt;/strong&gt;: Mit unseren flexiblen Arbeitszeiten &amp;amp; Remote Work gestaltest du deinen Alltag so, wie er zu dir passt. Außerdem kannst du Überstunden ausgleichen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vacation mode on&lt;/strong&gt;: Du erhältst 30 Urlaubstage plus einen flexiblen Tag – zusätzlich sind der 24. und 31.12. frei.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wellbeing first:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Gesundheitsleistungen, attraktive Altersvorsorge sowie Mental Health Awareness Days stellen deine Gesundheit in den Mittelpunkt.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Practice makes perfect&lt;/strong&gt;: Entfalte dich mit unseren vielfältigen Weiterbildungen und nutze unsere internen Karriereprogramme für deine Entwicklung im WPP-Netzwerk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;More than just a job&lt;/strong&gt;: Dich erwarten unvergessliche Events, Mitarbeitendenrabatte und weitere Highlights wie das Job Ticket, Wellhub oder das Job Bike.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be yourself&lt;/strong&gt;: Bei uns ist jede:r herzlich willkommen - Vielfalt und Chancengleichheit liegen uns am Herzen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Das bewegst du:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Als &lt;strong&gt;Senior Digital Campaign Manager&lt;/strong&gt; (Mensch) trägst du die Verantwortung für die Anlage und Aussteuerung von digitalen Kampagnen mit verschiedenen AdServern (Campaign Manager 360 und Adform).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team-Kollaboration:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Du arbeitest eng mit den Planungs-, Beratungs- und Investment-Management-Kolleg:innen sowie den Teams für SEA, Social und Programmatic zusammen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technische Abläufe:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Dabei stellst du optimale technische Kampagnenabläufe zwischen externen Media-Vermarktern, Adservern und Third-Party-Anbietern wie Nielsen, IAS und DoubleVerify sicher.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kreativ-Koordination: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Du koordinierst die Abstimmung mit Kreativagenturen zur Produktion der geplanten Werbemittel.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting &amp;amp; Learnings:&lt;/strong&gt; Auf Basis definierter KPIs erstellst du Kampagnenreportings, leitest belastbare Learnings ab und entwickelst daraus langfristige Optimierungsmaßnahmen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance-Management &amp;amp; Reporting:&lt;/strong&gt; Fortlaufend analysierst du die Performance, optimierst zur Steigerung der Kampagnenwirkung und kontrollierst das Pacing, damit die gebuchte Auslieferung erreicht wird.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Beratung &amp;amp; Empfehlungen:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Unsere Kundenteams berätst du souverän zur Kampagnenoptimierung und entwickelst selbstständig fundierte Handlungsempfehlungen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Das zeichnet dich aus:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ausbildung &amp;amp; Qualifikation:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Du hast ein abgeschlossenes Studium (vorzugsweise MINT/BWL/VWL) oder eine vergleichbare Qualifikation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Berufserfahrung:&lt;/strong&gt; Mindestens 2 Jahre Erfahrung im Online-Bereich als Ad-/Kampagnen-Manager gehören zu deinem Profil; relevante Online-KPIs und deren Optimierung sind dir bestens vertraut.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adtech &amp;amp; Reporting:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Du bringst Reporting-Erfahrung mit Sizmek, DCM oder Adform mit und kennst Third-Party-Anbieter wie Nielsen, DoubleVerify und IAS für Viewability und Brand Safety.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technische Grundlagen:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Grundkenntnisse in HTML und CSS helfen dir bei der Einschätzung und dem Troubleshooting technischer Set-ups.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tool-Skills &amp;amp; Analytik:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Sehr gute Office-365-Skills (insbesondere Excel, PowerPoint, Outlook) verbindest du mit hoher Zahlenaffi

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI. At our core is the Celonis Context Model — which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence into a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can actually understand, turning AI&#39;s operational blind spots into operational clarity. World&#39;s leading companies trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. We believe there&#39;s a massive opportunity to unlock global productivity and sustainability by giving AI the context to understand how every business process really works. Join our mission to make processes work for people, companies, and the planet.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Celonis Services is the delivery engine of our Celonis Customer Organization, responsible for turning the Celonis platform into measurable, business-critical outcomes for our customers. In the AI era, our role has elevated: as AI agents like our own Apollo take on more of the technical build, our people focus on the work that drives real impact—understanding our customers&#39; business-critical problems, designing the solutions that solve them, and quantifying the value delivered. Our Deployment Engineers and Deployment Architects pair deep domain and industry expertise with serious platform mastery and AI-augmented delivery, directing agentic systems while owning the judgment, architecture, and customer relationships that AI cannot replace. We deliver faster and smarter than ever, and we own the outcome: solution go-live, solution adoption, initial value realization support and the long-term success of our customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Lead / Principal Deployment Engineer, you are the backbone of Celonis delivery. You lead the hands-on implementation of Celonis solutions for enterprise customers, combining platform expertise with AI-augmented workflows to deliver high-quality outcomes, fast. You use Celonis’s AI deployment tools as your primary instruments - directing agents to build data models, generate analyses, and configure operational solutions, while applying your own judgment to validate outputs, adapt to customer context, and ensure business relevance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is not a traditional consulting role where you build everything manually. You are an AI-augmented delivery professional: you specify what needs to be built, direct AI agents to execute wherever possible, validate the results, and iterate with the customer. &lt;strong&gt;You generate value by understanding the customer’s business, translating their needs into technical specifications and solutions, and ensuring the platform delivers measurable impact.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Work You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Initiate and Connect&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct business discovery workshops to translate customers’ strategic objectives into high-impact Celonis use cases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with the customer’s IT and business stakeholders to define project scope, data requirements, and success criteria&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure data connectivity and extraction pipelines are properly configured, working with specialist resources if required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build &amp;amp; Value&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct AI deployment agents (Apollo) to build data models, process analyses, KPIs, and dashboards - writing clear specifications and validating agent outputs against business requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and configure Celonis solutions across the platform: Process Intelligence Graph, data transformations, process analysis, operational solutions, and AI-powered insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify process inefficiencies and root causes using Celonis technology, always in close collaboration with the customer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Validate AI-generated outputs for accuracy, business relevance, and alignment with customer context - applying domain knowledge where the AI cannot&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead value creation workshops and define measures to improve process inefficiencies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and build KPIs measuring the customer’s success and quantify business impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and build operational solutions to drive value, adoption and improve process conformance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Rollout, Adoption, and Handover&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enable key customer users to use and extend the solution independently, setting the foundation for long-term adoption&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage project outcomes against timelines, scope, and customer expectations&

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI. At our core is the Celonis Context Model — which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence into a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can actually understand, turning AI&#39;s operational blind spots into operational clarity. World&#39;s leading companies trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. We believe there&#39;s a massive opportunity to unlock global productivity and sustainability by giving AI the context to understand how every business process really works. Join our mission to make processes work for people, companies, and the planet.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Celonis Services is the delivery engine of our Celonis Customer Organization, responsible for turning the Celonis platform into measurable, business-critical outcomes for our customers. In the AI era, our role has elevated: as AI agents like our own Apollo take on more of the technical build, our people focus on the work that drives real impact—understanding our customers&#39; business-critical problems, designing the solutions that solve them, and quantifying the value delivered. Our Deployment Engineers and Deployment Architects pair deep domain and industry expertise with serious platform mastery and AI-augmented delivery, directing agentic systems while owning the judgment, architecture, and customer relationships that AI cannot replace. We deliver faster and smarter than ever, and we own the outcome: initial value realization, adoption, and the long-term success of our customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Lead Deployment Architect, you are the technical authority for our strategic accounts within Celonis delivery. You shape how Celonis solutions are designed, architected, and delivered across your portfolio of strategic customer engagements. You define what good delivery looks like - setting architectural standards, designing end-to-end solution strategies, and ensuring that AI-augmented and agentic workflows are deployed effectively at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You operate at the intersection of deep platform expertise, domain knowledge, and customer strategy. You are equally comfortable leading a technical design review with Celonis engineers and presenting a transformation roadmap to a customer’s C-suite. You bridge the gap between pre-sales and post-sales, ensuring that what was promised can be delivered - and often shaping the promise itself.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role carries significant organizational leverage. You set delivery patterns that other teams follow. You define how AI agents should be orchestrated for complex, multi-workstream engagements. You work in close collaboration with Deployment Engineers and raise the bar for the entire practice.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Work You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solution Architecture &amp;amp; Design&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support Services scoping in pre-sales, ensuring the right Services are positioned in line with the Celonis solution architecture proposed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design end-to-end Celonis solution architectures for complex enterprise deployments, spanning multiple process areas, business units, and geographies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the technical blueprint for how the Celonis platform integrates with customer systems, data strategies, and transformation goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Designing secure, scalable architectures tailored to complex enterprise requirements, optimizing for long-term usage growth and high concurrency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make architectural trade-off decisions: build vs. configure, custom vs. standard, phased vs. big-bang - with clear rationale tied to customer outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own solution quality &amp;amp; outcome delivery across engagements, conducting design reviews, and ensuring delivery teams follow architectural standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Orchestration &amp;amp; Delivery Innovation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design how AI deployment agents (Apollo) should be used across complex, multi-workstream engagements, defining agent workflows, validation checkpoints, and quality gates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop reusable specifications, templates, and patterns that enable Deployment Engineers to direct AI agents more effectively&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pioneer new delivery approaches that leverage AI to compress timelines, improve quality, or unlock use cases that were previously impractical&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set standards for AI output validation, ensuring the organization maintains quality as delivery accelerates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;GitLab is the intelligent orchestration platform for DevSecOps. GitLab enables organizations to increase developer productivity, improve operational efficiency, reduce security and compliance risk, and accelerate digital transformation. More than 50 million registered users and more than 50% of the Fortune 100* trust GitLab to ship better, more secure software faster.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The same principles built into our products are reflected in how our team works: we embrace AI as a core productivity multiplier, with all team members expected to incorporate AI into their daily workflows to drive efficiency, innovation, and impact. GitLab is where careers accelerate, innovation flourishes, and every voice is valued. Our high-performance culture is driven by our values&amp;nbsp;and continuous knowledge exchange, enabling our team members to reach their full potential while collaborating with industry leaders to solve complex problems. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OuZIb5zszQI&quot;&gt;Co-create the future with us&lt;/a&gt; as we build technology that transforms how the world develops software.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*&lt;em&gt;Fortune 500® is a registered trademark of Fortune Media IP Limited, used under license. Claim based on GitLab data. Fortune 100 refers to the top 20% ranked companies in the 2025 Fortune 500 list, published in June 2025. Fortune and Fortune Media IP Limited are not affiliated with, and do not endorse products or services of GitLab.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id=&quot;responsibilities-1&quot;&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supports GitLab’s&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/sales/field-operations/gtm-resources/#segmentation&quot;&gt;strategic large&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;prospects and customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide account leadership and direction in the pre- and post-sales process&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct sales activities including prospecting and developing opportunities in large/strategic accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure the successful rollout and adoption of GitLab products through strong account management activities and coordination with pre-and-post sales and support resources&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the voice of the customer by contributing product ideas to our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://gitlab.com/gitlab-org/gitlab/-/issues&quot;&gt;public issue tracker&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generate qualified leads and develop new customers in conjunction with our strategic channel partners .&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expand knowledge of industry as well as the competitive posture of the company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare activity and forecast reports&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to root cause analysis on wins/losses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate lessons learned to the team, including account managers, the marketing team, and the technical team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist sales management in conveying customer needs to product managers, and technical support staff&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilize a consultative approach, discuss business issues with prospect and develop a formal quote, a written sales proposal or a formal sales presentation addressing their business needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop an account plan to sell to customers based on their business needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Marketing on marketing strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;requirements-1&quot;&gt;Requirements&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A true desire to see customers benefit from the investment they make with you&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to provide high degree of account management and control&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work under minimal supervision on complex projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling into large organizations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to leverage established relationships and proven sales techniques for success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent negotiation, presentation and closing skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Preferred experience with Git, Software Development Tools, Application Lifecycle Management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You share our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/values/&quot;&gt;values&lt;/a&gt;, and work in accordance with those values.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to use GitLab&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to travel if needed and comply with the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/finance/travel/&quot;&gt;company’s travel policy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theatlantic.com/magazine/archive/2014/05/the-confidence-gap/359815/&quot;&gt;confidence gap&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;exists. The above list is intended to show the kinds of experience and qualities we’re looking for. If you’re reading this, do not match all of the requirements, and are hesitant to apply, we encourage you to make an application de

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape how AutoScout24 measures and grows revenue.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At AutoScout24, commercial decisions are increasingly driven by data. As a Senior Sales Analyst in our Global Sales Analytics team, you will act as a strategic partner to commercial leadership, helping shape how AutoScout24 measures performance, identifies growth opportunities and drives revenue growth across multiple markets&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will own business-critical revenue analytics products, identify growth opportunities, ensure KPI consistency across markets and translate complex commercial challenges into scalable analytical solutions. Beyond analysis, you will play a key role in maintaining and evolving the data products, pipelines and reporting foundations that enable reliable commercial decision-making across AutoScout24.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work across multiple markets, products and pricing models, balancing business needs with technical scalability and data quality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and continuously improve business-critical revenue analytics products that serve as the foundation for commercial performance reporting, KPI governance and strategic decision-making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build and maintain scalable data models, reporting layers and analytical solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure the reliability and scalability of our analytics ecosystem by managing data pipelines, validation frameworks and reporting foundations that support business-critical decision-making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Data Engineering to improve data architecture, automation and reporting scalability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive KPI consistency and reporting standards across markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify commercial opportunities and risks through advanced analysis and translate findings into actionable recommendations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support strategic initiatives such as market launches, pricing transformations and CRM changes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage AI-powered tools and modern analytics workflows to improve efficiency, automation and business impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years experience in Analytics, Business Intelligence, Revenue Operations or a similar field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong SQL and Python skills, with the ability to leverage AI-powered tools to accelerate analysis, automation and problem solving&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with workflow orchestration and pipeline management tools such as Airflow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing and maintaining reliable data models, reporting layers and analytical data products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with BI tools such as QuickSight, Tableau, Power BI or Looker&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to translate complex analytical findings into clear business recommendations and influence decision-making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What sets you apart&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You combine strong technical skills with business acumen and are comfortable discussing both data models and commercial strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are passionate about building scalable analytical solutions that deliver long-term business value&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You understand how data flows through pipelines, transformations and reporting layers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You combine analytical thinking with a strong engineering mindset and care about scalability, reliability and maintainability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are comfortable investigating data quality issues across multiple systems and identifying root causes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You challenge assumptions, ask the right questions and use data to drive better decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You balance speed with accuracy and maintain a high bar for data quality and trust&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You understand where AI can accelerate analytical workflows and where business context and human judgement remain essential&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt; Find  Jobs in Germany  on Arbeitnow

