&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Help ensure features are tested against real user workflows, edge cases, business rules, and operational expectations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Support rollout planning, user onboarding, training, and adoption follow-ups for new and existing product capabilities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
