&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Payroll Specialist&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why We Have This Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;As Qualtrics continues to scale globally, our payroll operations must be as innovative and reliable as our software. We are looking for a Payroll Specialist to ensure our 5,000+ employees across 25 countries are supported with precision. You will sit at the intersection of people and numbers, playing a critical role in major corporate milestones like M&amp;amp;A integrations and the launch of our new global payroll vendor. Working closely with Finance and HR leadership, you’ll help us build a world-class payroll function that thrives on accuracy and empathy.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How You’ll Find Success&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meticulous Accuracy: You have a &quot;measure twice, cut once&quot; mentality, ensuring complex data across multiple currencies and tax laws is flawless.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical Curiosity: You don’t just move data; you enjoy using Excel (vlookups, pivot tables) to find patterns, conduct audits, and identify efficiencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative Communication: You bridge the gap between different time zones and departments, creating trust through clear and proactive updates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entrepreneurial Initiative: You understand the desired outcome and work independently to research evolving tax regulations or solve problems before they escalate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adaptability: You thrive in a transformational environment, remaining calm and confidential while navigating the &quot;scrappy&quot; nature of a high-growth company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How You’ll Grow&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global Jurisdiction Expertise: Gain deep knowledge of payroll, tax, and labor laws across key APJ markets including Australia, South Korea, Hong Kong, Japan, India, and Singapore.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Systems Implementation: Participate in a major global payroll software rollout, giving you highly marketable technical implementation experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;M&amp;amp;A Exposure: Learn the complexities of corporate growth by assisting in the payroll and data integration of newly acquired companies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Things You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure Regional Operational Excellence: Support payroll operations for the APJ region to ensure 100% timely and accurate pay cycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive Data Integrity: Maintain the &quot;source of truth&quot; for all employment records and verifications to ensure seamless internal reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optimize Compliance: Conduct detailed audits of payroll, benefits, and long-term incentives to identify and implement corrective actions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support Global Transformation: Actively contribute to the implementation of our new global payroll system and M&amp;amp;A integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain Audit Readiness: Facilitate annual internal and external audits to ensure global compliance and risk mitigation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For On Your Resume&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Educational Foundation: Bachelor’s degree in Business, Human Resources, Finance, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capability over Tenure: No prior experience required. 2+ years of experience; we highly value ambitious recent graduates with strong internship experience in HR or Finance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical Proficiency: Demonstrated experience with Microsoft Excel (specifically vlookups and pivot tables).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt

&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Scale AI&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Scale AI accelerates the development and deployment of AI, from the high-quality training data and evaluation services that power the world&#39;s leading AI labs, to full-stack AI applications built for Enterprise, U.S. Public Sector, and Global Public Sector customers. We don&#39;t just hand over a model; we find the highest-value use case, build the system around it, and own the outcome, whether that&#39;s an agent supporting mission planning for the Department of Defense, a sovereign AI platform for a government ministry, or an agentic workflow inside a Fortune 500 enterprise. Our platform powers breakthroughs at the frontier of AI, and great design is how we make that power accessible, intuitive, and trusted by the teams who rely on it every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a product design leader to lead and grow our enterprise team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Set the direction for Enterprise design.&lt;/strong&gt; Define what exceptional design looks like for Scale&#39;s Applications customers making high-stakes decisions and for the expert contributors powering the platform. Translate the broader design vision into a clear, motivating direction for your team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build and lead the team.&lt;/strong&gt; Own hiring, development, and day-to-day leadership for a growing team of designers. Create the culture and operating rhythms that let them do their best work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive design execution across the Enterprise product.&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with your Product and Engineering counterparts to set priorities and ensure design is involved from problem scoping through delivery, not brought in at the end.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Raise the craft bar.&lt;/strong&gt; Uphold design principles and quality standards on your team. Push designers beyond digitizing workflows toward genuinely rethinking how people work with AI. Hold the line on quality without slowing delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contribute to the design system.&lt;/strong&gt; Help shape and adopt Scale&#39;s shared design system, championing consistent component use and contributing patterns back so a distributed team can build coherently at speed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ground the team in user needs.&lt;/strong&gt; Build the research habits and cadences that keep your team&#39;s decisions rooted in what enterprise customers and users actually need, and advocate for that discipline with your Product and Engineering partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape Scale&#39;s approach to human-agent interaction.&lt;/strong&gt; Scale&#39;s core value is human-in-the-loop AI, and the interface is where trust is built or lost. Help define the interaction patterns for how enterprise users work alongside AI agents, and contribute to Scale&#39;s growing point of view on this emerging space.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
